            "block_content": "6. In the event a new facility is opened which is connected to or is adjacent to an existing facility where employees are represented by another Union or in the event there is a combination of present facilities where employees in one of the combining existing facilities are represented by another Union, an appropriate procedure shall be agreed upon by which the matter of representation of such employees can be resolved.",
