        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8. The Employer recognizes the fact that bona fide supervisory employees are only those who have the authority to hire, promote, discipline, discharge or otherwise change status; and it is not its policy to establish jobs or job titles for the purpose of excluding such employees from the unit as established in Article II, Section 1 of this Agreement.",
